{
  "id": "pokemon-wonderland",
  "name": "Pokémon Wonderland",
  "category": "publication_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Pokémon Wonderland was a Shogakukan Special magazine; the cards here came with it from Vol. 2004, published on 20 December 2003, to Vol. 9 in July 2007. Its summer issues came out with that year's Pokémon film, most on its opening day in Japan, each with a card of one of the film's Pokémon: Sky-Splitting Deoxys with Vol. 2 in July 2004 for Destiny Deoxys, Rota's Mime Jr. with Vol. 5 in July 2005 for Lucario and the Mystery of Mew, Samiya's Chatot with Vol. 8 in July 2006 for Pokémon Ranger and the Temple of the Sea, and a Special Jumbo Card of Darkrai with Vol. 9 in July 2007 for The Rise of Darkrai. Its winter and spring issues brought Metang, Deoxys ex, Typhlosion, and the δ Delta Species Pikachu and Treecko. Most of their pictures are on English Nintendo Black Star or POP Series promos too.",
    "sources": [
      {
